          "speaker": "W",
          "text": "The teacher has the plants. Bring your old gloves. We will put the plants into large pots."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "M",
          "text": "Do we need to carry water from home?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "W",
          "text": "No, there is water at the garden. Bring a bottle for yourself, though."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "M",
          "text": "What if it rains?"
